+ * later record in the SAME batch names the same surface with different
+ * dimensions (GT5 Prologue's downsample chain clips one surface 1436, 511,
+ * 255 and 127 rows high in one frame), the old resource and its upload buffer
+ * were released on the spot -- wait_for_gpu() only drains work already
+ * submitted, not the list still being built -- so the list executed a copy
+ * and a barrier on freed resources. D3D12 reports that as message 921 under
+ * the debug layer and can hang the GPU without it.
